/E (Inspired by the Blueprint on Prosocial Tech Design Governance this Practical Guide offers guidance to regulators and civil society partners working towards tech platform governance. It captures insights from a diversity of technologists, peacebuilders, researchers and policy influencers associated with the Council on Tech and Social Cohesion and other peer organizations working towards safe and prosocial digital spaces. )
