659 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Apply the same rules to new AI technologies. Chatbots, AI assistants, and generative AI tools shape what people see and believe just like feeds do. These systems should follow comparable duties, adapted to their risk level: safety-by-default \(especially for minors\), clear labeling and provenance for AI-generated media, proportionate friction on high-risk actions \(e.g., mass AI messaging\), pre-launch risk and impact assessments, public change-logs, independent audits, and privacy-safe researcher access.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
