<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
661 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Through this Practical Guide, regulators can ensure addictive mechanisms are addressed, safer defaults are implemented, recommendations are safer and users feel a sense of agency for their online experiences on platforms.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
